{"text":"Dear {first_name},

This is our third reminder. We still need you to book a follow-up visit with {clinic_name}. This follows our earlier messages. Please book by {due_by}.

To book, call us at {clinic_phone}. We are glad to help you find a time that works.

If you do not want these reminders, you can stop them here: {opt_out_link}

Thank you,
{clinic_name}"}
